{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding","doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowBatchEncoder"]]},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowBatchEncoder\/batchLimit"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Snowplow’s trackers’ limits on one request, 25 events and 40,000 bytes of body, and an event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of up to 150,000 bytes in a request of its own."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"batchLimit","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BatchLimit","identifier":"doc:\/\/PropertyJSON\/documentation\/PropertyJSON\/BatchLimit","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12PropertyJSON10BatchLimitV"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Snowplow’s mobile trackers send at most 25 events and 40,000 bytes in a request by default,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and an event larger than that in a request of its own. A collector refuses a body over 2 MB"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with 413, and a request larger than its stream takes (192,000 bytes on SQS, 1 MB on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Kinesis, by default) becomes a failed event though the collector answers 200. So an event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of up to 150,000 bytes of JSON is sent alone, within the smallest of those, and a larger one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is left out as "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowEncodingError\/oversized(byteCount:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","title":"batchLimit","remoteSource":{"fileName":"SnowplowBatchEncoder.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowBatchEncoder.swift#L122"},"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"batchLimit"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12PropertyJSON10BatchLimitV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BatchLimit"}],"roleHeading":"Type Property","externalID":"s:16SnowplowEncoding0A12BatchEncoderV10batchLimit12PropertyJSON0cF0VvpZ","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"SnowplowEncoding"}]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/snowplowencoding\/snowplowbatchencoder\/batchlimit"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://SnowplowEncoding/documentation/SnowplowEncoding/SnowplowBatchEncoder/batchLimit":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowBatchEncoder\/batchLimit","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Snowplow’s trackers’ limits on one request, 25 events and 40,000 bytes of body, and an event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of up to 150,000 bytes in a request of its own."}],"url":"\/documentation\/snowplowencoding\/snowplowbatchencoder\/batchlimit","title":"batchLimit","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"batchLimit","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BatchLimit","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12PropertyJSON10BatchLimitV"}]},"doc://HTTPDestinations/documentation/HTTPDestinations/BatchE